{"id":"1242dfbca8a29bf9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/598_二元道义逻辑_DDL.md","title":"598 二元道义逻辑 DDL","display":"598_二元道义逻辑_DDL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>构造子类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl2}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl2}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>，并显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{obl2}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{obl2}(A,B)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\">\\(O(A\\mid B)\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(O(A\\mid B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{598}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{598}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(O(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(O(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{598}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{598}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{598}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{598}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{598}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,598}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,598}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{598}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{598})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{598}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{598})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{598}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{598}\\)</span>，替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(O(A\\mid B),\\sigma)=O(\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(A,\\sigma)\\mid\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(B,\\sigma)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(O(A\\mid B),\\sigma)=O(\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(A,\\sigma)\\mid\\operatorname{Sub}_{598}(B,\\sigma)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{598}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{598}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{598}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{598}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{598}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{598}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>二元道义公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{598}=\\{O(A\\mid B)\\to\\neg O(\\neg A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{598}=\\{O(A\\mid B)\\to\\neg O(\\neg A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{And}^{598}=\\{(O(A\\mid C)\\land O(B\\mid C))\\to O(A\\land B\\mid C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{And}^{598}=\\{(O(A\\mid C)\\land O(B\\mid C))\\to O(A\\land B\\mid C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}^{598}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B)\\land(C\\leftrightarrow D))\\to(O(A\\mid C)\\leftrightarrow O(B\\mid D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}^{598}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B)\\land(C\\leftrightarrow D))\\to(O(A\\mid C)\\leftrightarrow O(B\\mid D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{598}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{And}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}^{598}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{598}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{And}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}^{598}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{598}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{598}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件后件加强规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RM}^{598}=\\{((A\\to B),O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RM}^{598}=\\{((A\\to B),O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其显示分式分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{598}A\\to B}{\\vdash_{598}O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)}\\;(RM).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{598}A\\to B}{\\vdash_{598}O(A\\mid C)\\to O(B\\mid C)}\\;(RM).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{598}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RM}^{598}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{598}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{598}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RM}^{598}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{598}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{598}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{598}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{598}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{598}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{598}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RM}^{598}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RM}^{598}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{598}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{598}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{598}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{598}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{598}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{598}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{last}_{598}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{598}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{598}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{last}_{598}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{598}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{598}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{598}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{598}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-条件义务证书\">8. 条件义务证书</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tag}_{598}=\\{D,And,Ext,RM\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tag}_{598}=\\{D,And,Ext,RM\\}\\)</span>。可核验条件义务证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{598}=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi,\\rho):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\ \\rho\\in\\mathsf{Tag}_{598},\\\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{598}(\\Gamma),\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{598}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{598}=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi,\\rho):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\ \\rho\\in\\mathsf{Tag}_{598},\\\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{598}(\\Gamma),\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{598}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目用二元构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(A\\mid B)\">\\(O(A\\mid B)\\)</span> 取代一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"OA\">\\(OA\\)</span>，条件位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是对象语言公式的一部分。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{DyDeon}_{598}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{598},\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\operatorname{PV}_{598},\\operatorname{BV}_{598},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,598},\\mathsf{Subst}_{598},\\operatorname{Sub}_{598},\\mathsf{Ax}_{598},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{598},\\mathsf{Proof}_{598},\\operatorname{last}_{598},\\vdash_{598},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{598},\\mathsf{Tag}_{598},\\mathsf{Cert}_{598}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{DyDeon}_{598}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{598},\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\operatorname{PV}_{598},\\operatorname{BV}_{598},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,598},\\mathsf{Subst}_{598},\\operatorname{Sub}_{598},\\mathsf{Ax}_{598},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{598},\\mathsf{Proof}_{598},\\operatorname{last}_{598},\\vdash_{598},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{598},\\mathsf{Tag}_{598},\\mathsf{Cert}_{598}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含二元道义逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含偏好语义或输入输出逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-条件义务证书","text":"8. 条件义务证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl2}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl2}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{obl2}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"O(A\\mid B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{598}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{598}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\maths